  "history": "Eight new unit cases fail at the missing Rest button before implementation (1.51s); first native baseline also fails at that missing control (1.977s). Minimal Rest uses the unchanged finite preview scheduling. Five-control old CSS shrinks320px art to64px. First14rem balanced-row prototype collapses640px art to0;12rem threshold preserves normal two-row height, then reproduces0px art at200% text. Text-aware page-flow CSS retains160px art, wraps poses/categories and uses two-column item tiles. Initial flow run fails a fixture expectation that every enlarged layout must be one column; the wider stacked layout safely supports3+2. Fixture now accepts balanced3+2 or one column for enlarged text, retaining every art/target/label/focus bound. Final injected ten-layout probe passes. Prototype logs/CSS/captures retained. Historical test source versions were not separately archived.",
